      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a good idea imho. At least pre-download the world if you're dropping a portal. But then of course the time could run out before it's downloaded and there's the issue that you could potentially waste bandwidth of other people if they have the pre-downloading turned on. It'd be the most useful for streamers and such.\nAnother side thing would be nice if you could still talk to friends while in betweeen worlds.",
